### Create a new order
POST http://localhost:8081/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerName": "Jane Doe",
  "productName": "Smartphone",
  "quantity": 2,
  "price": 899.99
}

###

### Get all orders
GET http://localhost:8081/api/orders

###

### Get order by ID (Assuming ID 1)
GET http://localhost:8081/api/orders/1

###

### Update order by ID (Assuming ID 1)
PUT http://localhost:8081/api/orders/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerName": "Jane Doe",
  "productName": "Smartphone Pro Max",
  "quantity": 1,
  "price": 1099.99
}

###

### Delete order by ID (Assuming ID 1)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/orders/1
